  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_4888.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Las fiestas del Barrio de la Morer&iacute;a de Onda viven hoy otro d&iacute;a eminentemente gastron&oacute;mico. A mediod&iacute;a ha habido paellas al final de la calle Recinto y en la plaza de San Francisco de Paula. La comisi&oacute;n de fiestas y las personas colaboradoras han preparado una gran paella para homenajear a la Tercera Edad. Esta noche ser&aacute; la cena con la carne del toro del barrio que se embol&oacute; anoche.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4864.jpg\" alt=\"img_4864\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4865.jpg\" alt=\"img_4865\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4866.jpg\" alt=\"img_4866\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4867.jpg\" alt=\"img_4867\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4868.jpg\" alt=\"img_4868\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4869.jpg\" alt=\"img_4869\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4870.jpg\" alt=\"img_4870\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4871.jpg\" alt=\"img_4871\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasmoreria/img_4872.jpg\" alt=\"img_4872\" 